        q("waec-chem-equilibrium-002","chem-equilibrium","A catalyst added to a system at equilibrium:",listOf("Increases the equilibrium yield of products","Decreases the equilibrium constant","Does not change the equilibrium position","Stops the reverse reaction"),2,"A catalyst speeds up forward and reverse reactions equally and does not change the equilibrium constant or position."),
